<title>PHILIPPINES: Manila Central Bank to launch Yankee bond April 15.</title>
<headline>Manila Central Bank to launch Yankee bond April 15.</headline>
<dateline>MANILA 1997-04-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Philippine Central Bank said on Monday it would launch its maiden Yankee bond issue on April 15.</p>
<p>It hopes to sell $1 billion of the bonds in 30 and 100-year tranches. The deal will be closed on April 17.</p>
</text>
